  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your tactical gear with Rothco's Lightweight Shemagh Keffiyeh Scarf. Crafted from breathable cotton, it shields your head from sunrays, snow, sand, and debris. Versatile in design, this shemagh scarf transforms into a neck covering, headwrap, and more. Measuring 42\" x 42\", this tactical scarf is a survival essential, serving as a makeshift sling, fishing net, or storage pouch. Perfect for bug-out bags, the tactical scarf comes in over a dozen colors.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "19203",
  "description": "<p>Elevate your tactical gear with Rothco's Lightweight Shemagh Keffiyeh Scarf. Crafted from breathable cotton, it shields your head from sunrays, snow, sand, and debris. Versatile in design, this shemagh scarf transforms into a neck covering, headwrap, and more. Measuring 42\" x 42\", this tactical scarf is a survival essential, serving as a makeshift sling, fishing net, or storage pouch. Perfect for bug-out bags, the tactical scarf comes in over a dozen colors, including Olive Drab and Coyote Brown, catering to military personnel and fashion enthusiasts alike.</p>",
